#17619
The Gate to Sellatr~
You suddenly find yourself feeling all kinds of strange sensations.  You
realize that even though you are still breathing water into your lungs, you
are now standing on solid stone with no sensation of half-floating.  You can
suddenly see clearly with no wavering distortion.  AHA!...  You are no longer
moving through water!  You look about in amazement and you can see the ocean
is now held back on all sides and overhead by some invisible barrier!  To
your front is a large gate bordered by huge coral fans of pale green and  
yellow.  To your left is a small pyramid of stones, similiar to the one at
the beginning of this magical path.    
~
