The Empty Cell~
You see a small lightless room with something odd here. A sharpened
spoon, a burnt pile of straw, and an empty wine bottle lie on the
ground. You shine your light closer and see that on two of the walls
something has been scratched into the stone. Someone was confined here
yet now they are gone. Odd.....very odd.
~
